WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.287 --> 00:00:01.120
(audience applause)
- I brought ya a gift.

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.131
- First of all, you're invited
any time you bring alcohol.

00:00:04.131 --> 00:00:04.964
- [Nick] Yes.

00:00:04.964 --> 00:00:05.797
- So wait, what is this?

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:08.060
Villa One--
- So this is my new tequila

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.860
with John Varvatos.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.693
- [Kelly] Dang!

00:00:10.693 --> 00:00:11.570
- It started about two
and a half years ago.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.590
We started the process of
working' with Stoli Group

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:16.570
to develop our own tequila.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.403
- Um, can we try--

00:00:17.403 --> 00:00:19.350
I know this show airs at like 9 AM

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.290
and I'm lookin' at you Nashville.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.601
- Just a little bit.

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:22.976
- But yeah, I don't wanna be rude.

00:00:22.976 --> 00:00:23.809
- Yeah, yeah.
- So let's do it, Nick.

00:00:23.809 --> 00:00:24.660
(audience laughing)
Let's do it.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.115
- Congrats to you.

00:00:26.115 --> 00:00:27.220
- My mama raised a polite young lady,

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:30.020
so I will drink your tequila.
- Here's a little bit.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.320
Sorry we don't have enough for everybody.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.694
- I mean fine, I guess we're rationing it,

00:00:33.694 --> 00:00:34.527
but it's fine, it's fine.
(audience laughing)

00:00:34.527 --> 00:00:37.751
- Here we go, cheers.
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:37.751 --> 00:00:40.276
(audience cheering)

00:00:40.276 --> 00:00:41.253
- That is good!

00:00:41.253 --> 00:00:42.180
It's so smooth!

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.950
I was a little nervous
'cause usually I do,

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.682
I mean I don't drink ever but--

00:00:45.682 --> 00:00:46.515
(audience laughing)

00:00:46.515 --> 00:00:47.820
No, I do usually like salt and lime.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:48.914
That's really smooth!

00:00:48.914 --> 00:00:50.220
- Yeah, we're excited about it.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.220
So we just launched this one
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.700
- On the east coast and
the rest of the country's

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.312
kinda startin' out.

00:00:54.312 --> 00:00:56.456
But then we have Reposado
and Anejo as well,

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:57.289
that's comin' out.

00:00:57.289 --> 00:00:58.122
- I'm into it!

00:00:58.122 --> 00:00:59.490
So okay, let's celebrate real quick.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:00.323
You want another one?

00:01:00.323 --> 00:01:01.218
Okay fine, I will.

00:01:01.218 --> 00:01:02.210
(audience laughing)

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:04.980
Let's celebrate and drink to
your first season of The Voice.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:07.010
You don't have to.
(audience laughing)

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.510
Be a better person than
me, I'm tryin' to be kind.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:09.830
I just wanna celebrate the
fact that you're gonna be

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.090
on The Voice and I'm gonna kick your tail.

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:12.885
Oh!
- That's not true.

00:01:12.885 --> 00:01:14.525
(audience laughing)

00:01:14.525 --> 00:01:19.492
Incorrect.
(cheering)

00:01:20.804 --> 00:01:21.677
I'm not gonna clap for that.

00:01:21.677 --> 00:01:22.510
- I'm not gonna clap for that,

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:24.370
I refuse to clap for that, ma'am.

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:26.080
- It has been a good
little friendly competition

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:26.913
so far though.

00:01:26.913 --> 00:01:27.830
- It has!

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:30.110
- We've done the blinds,
which has been really fun.

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:31.590
My first ever.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:34.113
Assembled a good team, I
feel confident about it.

00:01:34.113 --> 00:01:37.301
- Yes, and we like a lot
of the same sound, yes?

00:01:37.301 --> 00:01:38.217
- I didn't expect that.

00:01:38.217 --> 00:01:39.050
- I did!

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:40.150
- I thought John and I
would go head to head.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:41.482
- No.
- But it's really you and I.

00:01:41.482 --> 00:01:42.315
- No, I knew it, I knew it.

00:01:42.315 --> 00:01:43.270
And the guys were tellin' me.

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.977
I was like, "I'm gonna have to
battle Nick freaking Jonas".

00:01:46.977 --> 00:01:48.420
(audience laughing)
Like, what?

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.280
I'm not gonna win there.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:52.353
I'm like so not cool
compared to you, like what?

